# Start from an empty build context. The Dockerfile copies the small explicit
# allowlist below, so local credentials, configurations, evidence, tests, and
# the separately packaged context experiment cannot be added to the image by
# an incidental broad COPY instruction.
**
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.ceph-rgw-conformance
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!requirements/
!requirements/oci-build-linux-amd64.lock
!requirements/oci-runtime-linux-amd64.lock
!hormuz/
!hormuz/**
!tools/
!tools/_verification_runtime.py
!tools/verify_ceph_rgw_custody_conformance.py
!tools/verify_ceph_rgw_custody_rotation_recovery.py
